.TP
tapectl\-cartridge\-mark\-erased(1)
Mark a cartridge as erased (available for reuse)
.TP
tapectl\-cartridge\-edit(1)
Correct a registered cartridge\*(Aqs generation and/or its claimed serial
.TP
tapectl\-cartridge\-relabel(1)
Correct a cartridge\*(Aqs barcode label
.TP
tapectl\-cartridge\-unretire(1)
Reverse a `cartridge retire`: the medium is fit after all
.TP
tapectl\-cartridge\-journal(1)
Show the MAM journal: every MAM read taken of a cartridge, verbatim
.TP
tapectl\-cartridge\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
